<p>		Sept. 28,    Sept. 30,     Sept. 28,    Sept. 30,</p>
<p>		  1996	   1995	   1996	    1995</p>
<p>Revenues    $12,800,000  $9,442,000  $35,303,000   $25,304,000</p>
